<title>UK: Nestle unit sets 100 mln rand bond. [CORRECTED 14:05 GMT]</title>
<headline>Nestle unit sets 100 mln rand bond. [CORRECTED 14:05 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NESTLE FINANCE FRANCE</p>
<p>(Lead manager corrects borrowing company name from Nestle (UK) Holding Plc.)</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  NESTLE SA</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN RAND  COUPON     14.75     MATURITY    24.MAR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.33    PAY DATE    24.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/SA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SWISS     TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
